## ✨ Features

- ⚡ FastAPI Framework: High-performance async API architecture with automated OpenAPI docs.
{%- if include_docker %}
- 🐳 Production Containerization: Gunicorn + Uvicorn worker setup with non-root security.
{%- endif %}
- 📋 Structured JSON Logging: Centralized logging formatter with native ContextVar request_id tracing.
- 🛠️ Modern Developer Tooling: Dependency management with uv and automated workflow execution with just.
- 🔍 Quality & Security Gates: Built-in static analysis (Ruff, ty), vulnerability auditing (pip-audit, pysentry-rs), and SAST (Semgrep).
{%- if include_genai %}
- 🤖 Generative AI Suite: Integrated modules for agents, prompts, contexts, runtimes{% if include_mcp %}, and Model Context Protocol (MCP){% endif %}.
{%- endif %}
- 🏗️ Clean Architecture: Modular division of layers (schemas, services, api, core{% if include_db %}, db{% endif %}{% if include_domain %}, domain{% endif %}{% if include_repositories %}, repositories{% endif %}).

