## 💻 Development Workflow

This project uses **`just`** to standardize all local development tasks. Run `just` without arguments to see the full list of available commands:

* **Code Quality & Linting**:
  * `just lint` — Check code with Ruff.
  * `just format` — Format code and auto-fix lint issues.
  * `just typecheck` — Run static type checking.

* **Testing & Coverage**:
  * `just test` — Run pytest test suite.
  * `just test-cov` — Run tests with terminal and HTML coverage reports.

* **Security & Audits**:
  * `just security` — Run vulnerability scans, SAST (Semgrep), dependency audits, and license checks.

* **Full CI Gate**:
  * `just ci` — Run the complete local verification gate (quality, tests, security).

